# Web assets under ego_server/static/admin/ are generated by
# `cd admin-ui && npm ci && npm run build` (bundle.js/css, theme.css, ide.js/css,
# workers/, assets/, *.LICENSE.txt) but ARE tracked: the Docker "web" stage
# copies tracked files only, so the committed copies are the baseline the image
# build refreshes. `npm run check` fails when they drift from a fresh build.
# Sources live in admin-ui/src/. Keep this list empty on purpose — every
# generated file must stay trackable.
